{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-08_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-08","title":"他鄉故知","storyCode":"10-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1aeae3e2dda2814fc721e907c792d3a32a48bd39a830c7a121420a0656f1414e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"被當成臨時關押點的廢棄工廠內，海蒂發現了薩卡茲雇傭兵的異樣。在博士的指揮下，阿米婭小隊與自救軍成功潛入了廢棄工廠。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:17 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，廢棄製醇廠"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，快點走！不許站著不動，都給我幹活去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍說了，這批材料必須在今天晚上弄完，然後送到車站去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哭什麼？你想偷懶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......別、別打我......我三四天沒睡覺，實在是太累了......啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請住手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人，敢擋住我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，站到我身後來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你是那個前兩天新來的。你是......老師？還是記者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，記不清，反正就是維多利亞盛產的那種浪費糧食的廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的花言巧語還是留給你們的貴族和富人吧，薩卡茲可不吃這套！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出、出血了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想就地處決我和我的同伴，那麼請便吧。不過別忘了，這裡還有一百多雙眼睛在盯著你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......都看什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在看你們準備怎麼對付我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一群俘虜而已，你以為我們會怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們當然不會。但工作不等人，不是嗎？你說的，你們將軍希望這批材料能在今天晚上加工完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，看到你們兩個的下場，他們說不定還能更有力氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是猜到了明天早上等著他們的是什麼，你覺得他們還願意把最後的夜晚花在為敵人打造武器上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！你怎麼知道明天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還知道，你們有必須讓我們活過今夜的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，她在激你，你可別犯傻，把不該說的都抖出來。趕緊走吧，我們也有活要幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別命令我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，也就是換了身衣服，脾氣變這麼大？你忘了是誰前陣子被幾個維多利亞殘兵打得一路喊媽媽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾吧，多嘴的雇傭兵。你的腦袋早晚會因為你的舌頭而掉下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這你得怪某個最近老在我耳邊嚷嚷的傢伙。相信我，我以前不是這麼說話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忙得很，沒工夫跟你們糾纏。行吧，就讓這些人多活幾個小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......尤其是你，別想著耍花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都給我聽好了，薩卡茲絕不養閒人，誰不樂意幹活，誰就挨刀子，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白的話就都動起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們暫時安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起，海蒂女士，我害您受了傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，只是弄髒了衣服而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您總是這麼從容......只要與您待在一起，我就會覺得很安心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再相信我一回，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回屋子裡去，和你的朋友們待在一起。薩卡茲還需要你們的巧手，他們暫且不會傷害你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於這些雇傭兵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們最好也別看熱鬧了，今天晚上有的忙，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎沒什麼可是的，赫德雷不是叫我們聽那些士兵的嗎？是他叫我們動起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別盯著這面牆了，這地方離出入口最遠，連只蟲子都飛不進來。瞧瞧這牆面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——多結實啊。走吧走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:27 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，地下結構"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行進，行進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告指揮官，三隊已準備完畢！確認九號出入口安全——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已確認，安全可通行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你怎麼來了？你的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我請求歸隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是指揮官說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......比爾在他們手上。他是為了掩護我......我不能在他生死未卜的情況下，只顧自己躺著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會救他回來。洛洛，我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，在你們心裡，我不是一個合格的隊長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是比爾在這裡，他會說，你是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一直相信你。我們......都相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信......我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這趟任務和我們過去那些暗地裡的救援任務不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可能會正面撞上很多薩卡茲士兵，遇到前所未有的危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，在加入自救軍之前，你才剛剛中學畢業，只是一名列車鍋爐工的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你也只是一個工匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲叫我們反抗軍......可哪來的軍隊？我們就只是倫蒂尼姆的普通人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對，我是很普通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記不住指揮官說的大道理，不管什麼時候，我心裡想的都是讓我的家人們活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，我其實很怕薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我更怕你們會在我看不見的地方死去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，洛洛......我也怕。我怕死，更怕我會害死你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說出來舒服多了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們出發吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和因陀羅會與自救軍一起守在這裡，達格達與摩根已經去找阿米婭會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們很少分頭行動。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"發生什麼事了嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟過去一樣，還是什麼都瞞不過你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也沒什麼，有些事情早晚得解決，只是需要一個恰當的時機而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"背負著所有人的期待前行，會很累。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"需要我和她們說什麼嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們剛剛抵達距離目標地點最近的出口。從這裡到製醇廠，我們還需要穿過兩個地下街區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的兩支小隊已經就位，他們會確保大家一路暢通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之後的指揮就交給你了，{@nickname}博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭......她就做得很好。她和阿米婭，她們也都背負著所有人的期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我想了一路，可能有些事我還沒有完全想明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是唯獨這件事，我必須自己處理。連最親近的同伴都拉不住的話，我回到這裡還有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，費斯特發來信號，他們已經抵達地面，我們需要立刻與他們會合——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們該出發了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們會時刻準備接應。"}]},{"label":"不知道倫蒂尼姆的空氣怎麼樣。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我也很想知道。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你們......一路暢通。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:55 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，廢棄製醇廠東側入口外"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布萊克，彙報前面的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前路暢通，彙報完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊小隊已就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。敵人數量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我視野內的有十二個。都是薩卡茲士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人指揮官位置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續警戒，等我信號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:09 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，廢棄製醇廠"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......本尼，那邊的房間關的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......下午被送進來的自救軍戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在遭受審訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲不會放過自救軍的任何一點消息。這位戰士他......他恐怕活不成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望他能再堅持一下，也許用不了多久......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那繼續盯著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷的排查結果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵們還在各個廠房盯著我們的俘虜。他們忙活了大半天，但我們抓來的人不少，要一個個查很花時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上裡面這個人也是硬骨頭，怎麼問都不肯開口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。讓他抓緊最後的時間。假如他仍然一無所獲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就又該輪到我登場了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——你、你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——收起你的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍！這個人他怎麼會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先去外面守著。這裡我來處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......將軍，你小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的吧？就算你讓他這一刀砍下來，我們也不會受傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下......請不要讓我的戰士受到更多驚嚇了，他們的弦已經繃得夠緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，我們只是不想遲到。畢竟你聽，裡面那位沒什麼聲息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，閣下來得正及時。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......廠房南區是誰在負責？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，是施瓦布帶的小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施瓦布......他五年前就在我隊裡幹過活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說......這就是你要我注意腳下影子的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確定施瓦布的位置。不，立刻叫他來見我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，廠房周圍是不是有些安靜？原本守在這裡的雇傭兵，他們都走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，一個都沒留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵的表現......有些古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們本來就很古怪，不是嗎？薩卡茲想和誰做朋友，又想殺了誰，從來不講道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這樣說話，除非你有意激怒他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，海蒂女士......被關在這裡半個多月，我很難不恨薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人會怪你。你做的已經夠好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了女士，還有消息說，除了今天中午就過來了的雇傭兵首領，那個薩卡茲將軍也在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......曼弗雷德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連他都......糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個陷阱。克洛維希婭......或許還有他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你擔心指揮官會在今天行動？我們得想個辦法通知他們......呃......但這麼多天了，我們找不到機會把消息傳出這面牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們一定也想過這會是陷阱。說不定......這同時是個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，通知其他人，我們的行動可能也要提前了。所有能戰鬥的人，做好戰鬥準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，就算我們能離開廠房，也很難衝破大門外的重重防守......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就到這裡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，有一位雇傭兵告訴我，這面牆非常......安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:45 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，廢棄製醇廠南牆外"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高一點......再飛高一點......這個位置很不錯，嗯......視野穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你看到什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......有三個入口，每處入口都有超過三十人把守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在東側入口守著的是薩卡茲，西南門也是薩卡茲......呃，但衣服不一樣，看起來是雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有北邊的正門......負責北門守衛的是......深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外園區裡還有至少五六支巡邏隊伍，在各個廠房之間來回走動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，等等......南邊，就離我們最近的這面牆，這地方是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照佈防情況，本來也該有一支隊伍在這裡巡邏......但他們好像消失了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這可能是陷阱。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"也許我們有幫手。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們是否按照原計劃行動？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，你覺得呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們必須救出海蒂女士。而且，我們得儘快去中央區......嗯......無論如何，我們都不能耽擱了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自救軍呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官說的，這次行動聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也有要救的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，雖然我很想說，不管你怎麼選，我們都會行動......但三隊的兄弟說得對，你是總指揮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好，計畫不變。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"摩根小隊，去東側入口。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，博士。達格達，我們走。"}]},{"label":"自救軍三隊分頭騷擾北門與西南門。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。行動！"}]},{"label":"可露希爾繼續負責偵察和支援。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，交給我吧。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，給其他人發信號。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人？羅德島還有人在地面上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，費斯特先生。等他們收到信號，他們會知道今晚我們在這裡有行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能看到他們的位置嗎，博士？應該還不能吧？距離還不夠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說他們不在附近？呃，博士難道有什麼特別的源石技藝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不是，是PRTS在幫我。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......什麼神奇的技術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，等回去以後，你可一定要好好跟我說一說。"}]},{"label":"是的，我能透視。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你不是在騙我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是帶著什麼特殊終端，帶顯示幕的那種！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然有人會來，我們要在外面等嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，如果他們判斷有必要與我們會合，那也是在我們進去之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們還是得解決怎麼進去的問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你說吧，走哪邊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們就走南邊。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是牆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，費斯特先生，你們有沒有辦法讓我們翻過那面牆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要試試看炸掉？我們新做了一批爆破裝置，要炸倒倫蒂尼姆的外牆是不可能的，但這個的話說不定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......有點難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆的廠房外牆都做過一定的防爆處理，除非能從內部引爆，否則的話，很可能炸不出理想效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......加大力度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，太引人注目了。這會讓摩根他們的努力白費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦......還不如讓摩根帶一點走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用滑索吧。我和洛洛在躲避巡邏隊的時候偶爾會用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強尼，把裝備拿過來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊隊長，你真沒讓我白背。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有備無患嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要洛克五號來定位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，差點忘了給你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是......洛克十七？怎麼會在你手上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為從地底爬出來的路上我還在加班啊！你看你看，都調整完了。我保證，它很穩定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不知道對你來說我的保證有沒有用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，我看過了，很穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個小耳朵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我順手加上去的，可露希爾牌無人機都有哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，你是不是不太喜歡？要是不喜歡的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用改回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那無人機沒問題了吧？我帶博士，強尼和加比自己走。洛洛......你可以帶阿米婭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我發射牽引裝置了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克十七，瞄準！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成功附著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛小姐，拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請抓緊我。這面牆不算高，但彈射的力量可能還是不小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"果然還是逃不過嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我什麼時候才能自己把握命運？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......都準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我們的機會可能只有一次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三、二、一——發射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
